 16+  4010              CHGMOD   EQU $005F      ; the screen mode in A
 17+  4010              INITXT   EQU $006C      ; text mode, 40 x 24, with the BIOS's tables (chapter 21)
 18+  4010              INIT32   EQU $006F      ; Graphic I, 32 x 24
 19+  4010              INIGRP   EQU $0072      ; Graphic II
 20+  4010              INIMLT   EQU $0075      ; multicolour
